---
import PageLayout from "../layouts/PageLayout.astro";

const siteName = "Lorem Ipsum Generator";
const contactEmail = "code.sudeepto@gmail.com";
---

<PageLayout
	title="Privacy Policy — Lorem Ipsum Generator"
	description="Read the Privacy Policy for Lorem Ipsum Generator. Learn what data we collect, how it's used, and your choices as a visitor to loremmaker.com."
	eyebrow="Legal"
	heading="Privacy Policy"
	updated="September 12, 2026"
>
	<p>
		This Privacy Policy explains what information {siteName} ("we", "us", or
		"our") collects when you visit loremmaker.com (the "Site"), and how that
		information is used.
	</p>

	<h2>Information we collect</h2>
	<p>
		The lorem ipsum generator itself runs entirely in your browser — the text
		you generate, the options you choose, and any content you paste are not
		transmitted to or stored on our servers.
	</p>
	<p>We may automatically collect limited technical data when you visit the Site, including:</p>
	<ul>
		<li>Browser type and version</li>
		<li>Device and operating system information</li>
		<li>Pages visited and time spent on the Site</li>
		<li>Referring website or search engine</li>
		<li>General location derived from IP address (e.g. country or region)</li>
	</ul>

	<h2>Cookies and analytics</h2>
	<p>
		We may use cookies or similar technologies (such as privacy-conscious
		analytics tools) to understand aggregate usage patterns and improve the
		Site. These do not identify you personally. You can disable cookies in
		your browser settings at any time; the generator will continue to work
		without them.
	</p>

	<h2>Advertising (Google AdSense)</h2>
	<p>
		We display advertising served by Google AdSense and may work with other
		advertising partners. Google and its partners use cookies and similar
		technologies, including the DoubleClick cookie, to serve ads based on
		your visits to this and other websites. Advertising cookies may be used
		to personalize ads, limit how often you see an ad, and measure ad
		performance. We do not give advertisers access to the text you generate
		or the options you choose in the generator.
	</p>
	<p>
		You can opt out of personalized advertising by visiting{" "}
		<a href="https://adssettings.google.com" rel="noopener noreferrer">Google Ads Settings</a>,
		or learn more about how Google uses data from sites that use its
		services at{" "}
		<a href="https://policies.google.com/technologies/partner-sites" rel="noopener noreferrer">policies.google.com/technologies/partner-sites</a>.
		You can also opt out of some third-party vendors' use of cookies at{" "}
		<a href="https://www.aboutads.info" rel="noopener noreferrer">aboutads.info</a>.
		Where required by law (for example in the European Economic Area, the
		United Kingdom, and Switzerland), ads and related cookies are shown
		according to the consent choices you make in the consent notice.
	</p>

	<h2>How long we keep data</h2>
	<p>
		We do not hold generated text or generator settings on our servers.
		Server and analytics logs, where kept, contain only the technical data
		listed above and are retained only as long as needed to operate and
		secure the Site. Settings stored in your browser remain there until you
		clear your site data.
	</p>

	<h2>Local storage</h2>
	<p>
		We use your browser's local storage to remember your light/dark theme
		preference and your last-used generator settings (amount, unit, theme,
		and export format). This data stays on your device and is never sent to us.
	</p>

	<h2>Third-party services</h2>
	<p>
		We may use third-party services for hosting, analytics, or error
		monitoring. These providers may collect technical data as described
		above under their own privacy policies. We do not sell your personal
		information to third parties.
	</p>

	<h2>Your rights and choices</h2>
	<p>
		Depending on where you live (for example under the GDPR or the CCPA),
		you may have the right to ask what personal data we hold about you, to
		request correction or deletion, or to object to certain processing.
		Because we do not create accounts or store generated content, there is
		usually little to retrieve, but you can email us at the address below
		and we will respond to any request within a reasonable time.
	</p>

	<h2>Hosting and security</h2>
	<p>
		The Site is served over HTTPS from a global content delivery network
		(Cloudflare), which processes standard request data such as IP addresses
		to deliver pages and protect against abuse.
	</p>

	<h2>Children's privacy</h2>
	<p>
		The Site is not directed at children under 13, and we do not knowingly
		collect personal information from children.
	</p>

	<h2>Changes to this policy</h2>
	<p>
		We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. Changes take effect
		when posted on this page, with the "Last updated" date revised
		accordingly.
	</p>

	<h2>Contact us</h2>
	<p>
		Questions about this Privacy Policy? Email us at{" "}
		<a href={`mailto:${contactEmail}`}>{contactEmail}</a> or visit our{" "}
		<a href="/contact">Contact page</a>.
	</p>
</PageLayout>
